  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Production of Foundation Seeds” by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, is designed to support farmers in the production of foundation seeds, particularly for pulses. Eligible farmers receive a subsidy. Special benefits are provided for SC/ST farmers (24%) and farm women (20%).\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n- The beneficiary should be a Farmer.\n- The beneficiary should be a resident of Tamil Nadu.\n- The beneficiary should raise seed farms with Pulses crop.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
